==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crown Zenith|Gloom|2}} from the {{TCG|Crown Zenith}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gloom}}.
* '''Leaf Step''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Shining Celebi|79}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

